# Frontend conventions

- No bundler: `src/` is served raw by Tauri; `public/` is the marketing site
- Keep IPC invokes aligned with registered commands (IPC contract tests enforce this)
- Every `getElementById` used in JS must exist in markup (DOM contract tests)
- Do not auto-execute from Guard Desk / ID-scan / AI suggestions — preview only
- Prefer surgical edits in `src/main.js`; avoid wholesale reflows of shared UI
- Marketing copy must match shipped capability (preview vs notarized, version tags)
